>> title: No-Knead Bread
>> category: Breads
>> tags: bread, yeast, oven, overnight
>> servings: 12
>> time: 20 hr
>> step.1: whisk in a large bowl
>> step.2: stir to a shaggy dough
>> step.3: cover, rise 18 hours at room temperature
>> step.4: shape into a ball
>> step.5: dust, then rest 2 hours
>> step.6: bake in a Dutch oven 450°F, 30 min covered + 15 min open

Whisk @bread flour{3%cup}(400 g), @whole wheat flour{1/2%cup}(60 g), @instant yeast{1/4%tsp}(0.8 g), and @fine sea salt{1 1/2%tsp}(9 g) in a #large bowl{}.

Stir @cool water{1 1/2%cup}(355 g) into @&(~1)dry mix{}.

Cover @&(~1)dough{} and leave at room temperature for ~{18%hours}.

Shape @&(~1)dough{} into a ball on a surface dusted with @all-purpose flour{2%Tbs}.

Dust @&(~1)loaf{} with @cornmeal{2%tsp} and rest ~{2%hours}.

Bake @&(~1)loaf{} covered in a #Dutch oven{} at 450°F for ~{30%min}, then uncovered ~{15%min}.
